  "source_caption": "Made by a single animator using free Blender software, Violet & Marlowe Rob A Bank has won Best Animated Short at the Tribeca Film Festival.\n\nDirected by Wesley Wang and animated by Jacob Rivera, the film follows two young lovers on a bank robbery gone wrong, all brought to life through expressive hand-crafted animation.\n\nThe entire short is soundtracked by adore’s “Feel It All Again,” with the song carrying the story from beginning to end and becoming an essential part of the film’s emotional impact.\n\nIt’s an impressive reminder of what independent artists can create with talent, vision, and accessible tools.\n\n🎵: “Feel It All Again” — adore",
